# =========================================================
# PUBLIC PROJECT ASSETS
# =========================================================
#
# These folders are intentionally included in GitHub:
#
# View_Outputs/             -> Project screenshots
# trained-sample-videos/    -> Training/sample videos
# demo-videos/              -> User testing/demo videos
#
# Do NOT add global video-extension rules such as
# *.mp4, *.mov, *.avi, etc., because these folders
# intentionally contain videos that must be committed.
#

!View_Outputs/
!View_Outputs/**

!trained-sample-videos/
!trained-sample-videos/**

!demo-videos/
!demo-videos/**